7. Sellers Table
Table Name

silver.olist_sellers

Source

bronze.olist_sellers

Transformations Performed
Data Cleaning
Removed unnecessary spaces from seller fields.
Standardized seller state values into uppercase format.
Invalid Data Handling
Detected invalid city values containing numeric characters.
Replaced invalid city names with “unknown”.

Reason:
Some rows contained ZIP-code-like values instead of actual city names.

Data Preservation
Seller records were preserved even when city information was invalid.
Data Validation
Removed records with missing seller IDs.
